  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "一位木匠的态度，依我看来，应该是：（一）努力成为一名优秀的木匠；（二）即使自己已是优秀的木匠，也绝不能小觑皮匠、鞋匠、泥水匠，以及所有其他工匠。",
      "output_sha256": "e63d9386a12f6546471f3cc222e40391f5ac24fb6187216abca3196350ea7b0a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": 0.50492,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        1
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "07f2e7c8e2217e7b5878e6c00294bc501add6fc100b11b5584045840de836d19"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_ai_sha256": "e63d9386a12f6546471f3cc222e40391f5ac24fb6187216abca3196350ea7b0a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "这种态度不仅适用于木匠，也适合文学创作者。",
      "output_sha256": "e8463e8f74b1359cbe2c4473cb561b46f1cb5f29e650513f7fa4e5c290e0abd3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": 0.538064,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        2
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "47eef1664540b757b272034fc325a1b4c14b37ef641426b1b260901b99c83663"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_ai_sha256": "e8463e8f74b1359cbe2c4473cb561b46f1cb5f29e650513f7fa4e5c290e0abd3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我想，一位写家既已成为写家，就该不管生活怎么苦，工作怎样繁重，还要继续努力，以期成为好的写家，更好的写家，最好的写家。",
      "output_sha256": "a92afe49b4542aa470e174f71396e7dd7e8c8b66c9d5d8fd06e32475c822081c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_human_sha256": "a92afe49b4542aa470e174f71396e7dd7e8c8b66c9d5d8fd06e32475c822081c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "同时，他须认清：一个写家既不能兼作木匠，瓦匠，他便该承认五行八作的地位与价值，不该把自己视为至高无上，而把别人踩在脚底下。",
      "output_sha256": "580c1b61ce733021483e53538844ce57d7d5c2531b777c03287621062784e3a9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_human_sha256": "580c1b61ce733021483e53538844ce57d7d5c2531b777c03287621062784e3a9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我有三个孩子。",
      "output_sha256": "88f72e60fcb5e1afb8e529735713efac68a2d65501e59c2b6b41b97c0e4f72b4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": 0.728571,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        5
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "7a9fe929a62db8bea538094eb1681466b2484e735760b93552b2f5853b8fbced"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_ai_sha256": "88f72e60fcb5e1afb8e529735713efac68a2d65501e59c2b6b41b97c0e4f72b4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "除非他们自己愿意，而且极肯努力，作文艺写家，我决不鼓励他们；因为我看他们作木匠，瓦匠，或作写家，是同样有意义的，没有高低贵贱之别。",
      "output_sha256": "d4690176b871579f8063e74408f247eba7a54e3ba10908b78f376f95ac4c053e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_human_sha256": "d4690176b871579f8063e74408f247eba7a54e3ba10908b78f376f95ac4c053e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "假若我的一个小孩决定作木匠去，除了劝告他要成为一个好木匠之外，我大概不会絮絮叨叨的再多讲什么，因为我自己并不会木工，无须多说废话。",
      "output_sha256": "83aa37c5ede35c90129e3585731e4a94a8f86d82daab1d2f53370c65b9709645",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_human_sha256": "83aa37c5ede35c90129e3585731e4a94a8f86d82daab1d2f53370c65b9709645",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "如果他选择成为文学写作者，我就会多说一些，因为我对这个领域的艰辛有些了解。",
      "output_sha256": "ae94a0257ea4a455e2ae9447205146743529a9bfeedfd7c20c43b1c03a023b00",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": 0.355725,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        8
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "02c16696ea517cb37210809a62fbbed5419d0fdd6f1d85c5ff3e2f6505fd92a2"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ae94a0257ea4a455e2ae9447205146743529a9bfeedfd7c20c43b1c03a023b00",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        8
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "第一，我要问他：你有了什么准备？",
      "output_sha256": "05ff16388c5d85a63f0d8e32471306715bcffe3073f191a16781b335a977aec9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_human_sha256": "05ff16388c5d85a63f0d8e32471306715bcffe3073f191a16781b335a977aec9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "假若他回答不出，我便善意的，虽然未必正确的，向他建议：你先要把中文写通顺了。",
      "output_sha256": "0947e702faaaf951f17e895d8794db98fb15c70f78b4a91d75f650824766ff7d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_human_sha256": "0947e702faaaf951f17e895d8794db98fb15c70f78b4a91d75f650824766ff7d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "所谓通顺者，即字字妥当，句句清楚。",
      "output_sha256": "0749ae671c10e1a14a51716ebcfcb5bdef6418577382da48480eba56cb705e36",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_human_sha256": "0749ae671c10e1a14a51716ebcfcb5bdef6418577382da48480eba56cb705e36",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "假若你还不能作到通顺，请你先去练习文字吧，不要开口文艺，闭口文艺。",
      "output_sha256": "5b1a4a72b659a56c173deb30ab5a7486be9c37f623382d22b64e88fb6d0f5d0c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_human_sha256": "5b1a4a72b659a56c173deb30ab5a7486be9c37f623382d22b64e88fb6d0f5d0c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "文字写通顺了，你要“至少”学会一种外国语，给自己多添上一双眼睛。",
      "output_sha256": "ae3717d425cdb18342ee020df063e1381c6fc9ad64f18321bfefa55ac837a6f2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_human_sha256": "ae3717d425cdb18342ee020df063e1381c6fc9ad64f18321bfefa55ac837a6f2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "这样，中文能写流畅，外文也能阅读，接下来你还需要去生活。",
      "output_sha256": "6eb0e1695bb85811e9ce8322f45cc411ac97e5abb2d698b333c7b8dc0bbac8e4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": 0.528154,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        14
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "0d9838028282a145db6a928615a6a7b87e13a49601597a662977f0f58d2a79b2"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_ai_sha256": "6eb0e1695bb85811e9ce8322f45cc411ac97e5abb2d698b333c7b8dc0bbac8e4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        14
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我看，你到三十岁左右再写东西，绝不算晚。",
      "output_sha256": "428cfd4aa27e23c8f2588914fe59cf4ab697340e67b2e717487d332674e54cad",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_human_sha256": "428cfd4aa27e23c8f2588914fe59cf4ab697340e67b2e717487d332674e54cad",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "第二，我要问他：你是不是以为作家高贵，木匠卑贱，所以才舍木工而取文艺呢？",
      "output_sha256": "7db4924a2748cea0329d313afa4e8d19e1085628cfa6a670476c63553c719a42",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_human_sha256": "7db4924a2748cea0329d313afa4e8d19e1085628cfa6a670476c63553c719a42",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "假若你存着这个心思，我就要毫不客气的说：你的头脑还是科举时代的，根本要不得！",
      "output_sha256": "7f92c372fea29d356af87287dfb17ebc04930bc107abdc4af162ecf17bbc3aa5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_human_sha256": "7f92c372fea29d356af87287dfb17ebc04930bc107abdc4af162ecf17bbc3aa5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "况且，去学木工手艺，即使不能成为第一流的木匠，也还可以成为一个平常的木匠；即使不能有所创造，还能不失规矩的仿制；即使供献不多，也还不至于糟蹋东西。",
      "output_sha256": "95b24088d521b9ecbc719369d369f1f8caa6ecd7ccef9031363e36a6c5f6f397",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_human_sha256": "95b24088d521b9ecbc719369d369f1f8caa6ecd7ccef9031363e36a6c5f6f397",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "至于文艺，如果你做得不好，那就会浪费无数的纸笔和时间——包括你自己的、印刷厂的以及读者的；这是无法弥补的损失！",
      "output_sha256": "8b85a2f556704d7c4928e7fb58aa8567149bb704c97094b283a38fa308d57813",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": 0.473749,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        19
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "55ba32a5c6732ed2f6cd3c75314aac7523c2ab1d8ff71e052fdf84dc21f744f4"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_ai_sha256": "8b85a2f556704d7c4928e7fb58aa8567149bb704c97094b283a38fa308d57813",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        19
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "你看我，已经写作快二十年了，成就又在哪里？",
      "output_sha256": "49fd5ae2d45cf9ee30c0511a7b0b3d4a883a9906dc042148768595e01f295c6a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": 0.633,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        20
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "1db3b31ee36c0fd7fa4ed2bf8bd54573e691ed9786336ff764e7ddf42a2cf4ff"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_ai_sha256": "49fd5ae2d45cf9ee30c0511a7b0b3d4a883a9906dc042148768595e01f295c6a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我只感到愧悔，没有替人盖成过一间小屋，作成过一张茶几，而只是浪费了多少笔墨，谁也不曾得到我一点好处！",
      "output_sha256": "36d3fa95b61e53d5511ec6ee81a5e849fd57cc54971acada97c9cb82418ccf55",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_human_sha256": "36d3fa95b61e53d5511ec6ee81a5e849fd57cc54971acada97c9cb82418ccf55",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "高贵吗？",
      "output_sha256": "b05938080a855f7962bea3c71b607fde758eb5dbb966d03028ac6ddee95ad258",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_human_sha256": "b05938080a855f7962bea3c71b607fde758eb5dbb966d03028ac6ddee95ad258",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "世上还有许多高贵的废物呢。",
      "output_sha256": "85dd9dab97abf57f54b73537b771c221ef37e0eb6070d76e4d2b9a9eef22d55e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": 0.784253,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "9567aa9a1f898c6b9889da0fbdccdf6fa6e44390f1e1981d3bbcd9f76b510abb"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_ai_sha256": "85dd9dab97abf57f54b73537b771c221ef37e0eb6070d76e4d2b9a9eef22d55e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "第三，我会问他：你是否认为作作家比做其他工作更轻松？",
      "output_sha256": "4592f605bb8192126b832d29de5f105ee18d771d01b19daaf2bca029a7f8cb2f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": 0.534658,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        24
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "e6ff788d70dcde3529510a950cda8024fb07b5fb939fc5ebdd2b313666ddbbe1"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_ai_sha256": "4592f605bb8192126b832d29de5f105ee18d771d01b19daaf2bca029a7f8cb2f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        24
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "比如说，作木匠，须学好几年的徒，出师以后，即使技艺出众，也还不过是个默默无闻的匠人；治文艺呢，你可以用一首诗，一篇小说，而成名呢？",
      "output_sha256": "9d683b9e69f6573ca42275325208ad29644c787bf688fee72f3fdbf4dc7f5b78",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_human_sha256": "9d683b9e69f6573ca42275325208ad29644c787bf688fee72f3fdbf4dc7f5b78",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我告诉你，你这是有意取巧，避重就轻。",
      "output_sha256": "d477f8a5a804c35f28cb895e07c2c6a848ac8e20fd7d7b89ddd22a6594a19f17",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_human_sha256": "d477f8a5a804c35f28cb895e07c2c6a848ac8e20fd7d7b89ddd22a6594a19f17",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "你要知道，你心中若没有什么东西，而轻巧的以一诗一文成了名，名适足以害了你！",
      "output_sha256": "95e5a25f0534fcab72d6fe54c643671ceee22a31c07803ca384a92a0c0aec34a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_human_sha256": "95e5a25f0534fcab72d6fe54c643671ceee22a31c07803ca384a92a0c0aec34a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "名使你狂傲，狂傲即近于自弃。",
      "output_sha256": "1b8893c3003f2d8c844d55a7fe9cc3d76501918695674d62746348a3a28fa9d9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_human_sha256": "1b8893c3003f2d8c844d55a7fe9cc3d76501918695674d62746348a3a28fa9d9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "名声让你变得浮躁、虚伪。",
      "output_sha256": "a79682c7c5611d22ab94113adf44cd13d7a61015f125bb4b60137f108f14dc04",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": 0.451134,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        29
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "ed10599f24c2fbcf4839cc7f6374701da2ee3d6a3efc8fd558ec17e437e35a4e"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_ai_sha256": "a79682c7c5611d22ab94113adf44cd13d7a61015f125bb4b60137f108f14dc04",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        29
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "文艺不是轻而易举的东西，你若想借它的光得点虚名，它会极厉害的报复，使你不但挨不近它的身，而且会把你一脚踢倒在尘土上！",
      "output_sha256": "16dace6a8148d755ec549878906abfbfe23fa7584a792dbd4d91e0c428fc77a9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_human_sha256": "16dace6a8148d755ec549878906abfbfe23fa7584a792dbd4d91e0c428fc77a9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "得了虚名，而丢失了自己，最不上算！",
      "output_sha256": "a9760bbf67b483ddb612193fe05b10081e6612d44cdd956ed0712275e23551b1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_human_sha256": "a9760bbf67b483ddb612193fe05b10081e6612d44cdd956ed0712275e23551b1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "第四，我要问他：你若干文艺，是不是要干一辈子呢？",
      "output_sha256": "ae609d3edeb96fd235f56692169f81c2ebc2cc8f16602857bd65cf1706e809e7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_human_sha256": "ae609d3edeb96fd235f56692169f81c2ebc2cc8f16602857bd65cf1706e809e7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "假若你只干一年半载，得点虚名便闪躲开，借着虚名去另谋高就，你便根本是骗子！",
      "output_sha256": "9f9f324fcff0bab80a8cdc32f9ce8b5c3fac1ac03cddb121034fb8aeef4a352d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_human_sha256": "9f9f324fcff0bab80a8cdc32f9ce8b5c3fac1ac03cddb121034fb8aeef4a352d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我宁愿你死了，也不忍看你作骗子！",
      "output_sha256": "ad813c2cb646590a94264be85ed0c90f7fe1b0023142e0fc516bbbe996fa16f0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_human_sha256": "ad813c2cb646590a94264be85ed0c90f7fe1b0023142e0fc516bbbe996fa16f0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "你必须明白：从事文艺创作并不比做木匠高贵，反而更为艰难。",
      "output_sha256": "ea6ee8cf6e2350f881d734f5653ffcc331c1baa14791ebe0634b784c469050a1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": 0.505154,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        35
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f06ab514e55f68c3530fa49a5d0d52680988b8050b125b58807c6ca508a0a0dd"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ea6ee8cf6e2350f881d734f5653ffcc331c1baa14791ebe0634b784c469050a1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        35
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "在文艺里找黄金美人，你算是看错了地方！",
      "output_sha256": "d1d8084ee78cc070a65a8dab0a523459b5e68ced4f8680fa2c5c6bbae22f4a2f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_human_sha256": "d1d8084ee78cc070a65a8dab0a523459b5e68ced4f8680fa2c5c6bbae22f4a2f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "第五，我要告诉他：你别以为我干这一行，所以你也必须来个“家传”。",
      "output_sha256": "b6145fdb1b43c3e194919c63527de0203a789d14cfa2346a0334f29cdb54023b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_human_sha256": "b6145fdb1b43c3e194919c63527de0203a789d14cfa2346a0334f29cdb54023b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "世上有用的事多得很，你有择取的自由。",
      "output_sha256": "a1eb6ed7aa203335f2c4c1e41d4472bc37164a43f9eff07e61b681a1d03d8b1f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_human_sha256": "a1eb6ed7aa203335f2c4c1e41d4472bc37164a43f9eff07e61b681a1d03d8b1f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我并不轻视文艺，就如同我不轻视木匠一样。",
      "output_sha256": "a5115cb77b122fcdecc004310d5e0fa58a9195d5c619575810acf65a2d91e72f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": 0.666895,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        39
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "370a8e5938e43947ff2a54097a92bf24461e7e3205d571fe67ecaf6bcd3d80f5"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_ai_sha256": "a5115cb77b122fcdecc004310d5e0fa58a9195d5c619575810acf65a2d91e72f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        39
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "但我也不会过于重视文艺，因为只有文艺而没有木匠，世界也无法运转。",
      "output_sha256": "e4495909ce411ad4d650b885af52a683824ecb8cd94e8fe358f6a19b060d3bc0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": 0.707139,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        40
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a7172ffe2f97a00623018f5aefba4187c200ffdc3c3cebe3000ec58f2dbf3d39"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_ai_sha256": "e4495909ce411ad4d650b885af52a683824ecb8cd94e8fe358f6a19b060d3bc0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我不后悔干了这些年的笔墨生涯，而只恨我没能成为好的写家。",
      "output_sha256": "a5828543da96e7e8cb830712480a8ae851434ecc73aee9128856acccb5b2f8a2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 41,
      "source_human_sha256": "a5828543da96e7e8cb830712480a8ae851434ecc73aee9128856acccb5b2f8a2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "作官教书都可以辞职，我可不能向文艺递辞呈，因为除了写作，我不会干别的；已到中年，又极难另学会些别的。",
      "output_sha256": "639bfd8081b17c9b7d9b656bbf71617c858d2b1eed39b3bd227c22b0e6f72024",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_human_sha256": "639bfd8081b17c9b7d9b656bbf71617c858d2b1eed39b3bd227c22b0e6f72024",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这是我的痛苦，我希望你别再来一回。",
      "output_sha256": "be3437a4c8f190e604ccdda1c7fd889c7278544e03e84f47b7d1d423dc12a27f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 43,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 43,
      "source_human_sha256": "be3437a4c8f190e604ccdda1c7fd889c7278544e03e84f47b7d1d423dc12a27f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "不过，如果你真心想成为写作者，就必须按照我之前所说的去准备，我也无法绝对反对你，你拥有自己的选择。",
      "output_sha256": "4c2fd71b34473697de7d3745a5f34dd689ef68d023891e9dec8a8edbc360bd5e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 44,
      "alignment_score": 0.425832,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        44
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "c7224e17afd58198bb44b314d83c6dadd6f0ebfb147c747e2ac8bdc199a4510c"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 44,
      "source_ai_sha256": "4c2fd71b34473697de7d3745a5f34dd689ef68d023891e9dec8a8edbc360bd5e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        44
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "你必须认真准备啊！",
      "output_sha256": "53243cb59e65d740a6340f927b3a68fd55d8807f7d6d2f8596774493a566896f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 45,
